return only that field’s value as a single bare value, instead of the full quote. This is convenient for spreadsheet functions such as the Excel WEBSERVICE function. For 
example, filter=close returns the latest price and filter=change_p returns the percentage change. URL cURL PHP Python R Chat GPT https://eodhd.com/api/real-time/ AAPL.US ? 
api_token = demo & fmt = json & filter = close ( Sign up for free to get an API token) curl --location "https://eodhd.com/api/real-time/ AAPL.US ? api_token = demo & fmt = 
json & filter = close " ( Sign up for free to get an API token) $curl = curl_init(); curl_setopt_array($curl, array( CURLOPT_URL => 'https://eodhd.com/api/real-time/ AAPL.US 
